{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-369257-r4522822","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Coffee Cake","sourcePageId":369257,"sourceRevision":"4522822","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-11T19:59:01Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Coffee%20Cake&oldid=4522822","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:21.252Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cake","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using baking soda","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cow milk","Category:Recipes using cream cheese","Category:Recipes using dark chocolate","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using raspberry","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"16d4b064d9c6607d69874717ed735483dceae695849771cf830b13452195fcd1","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cake recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n==Ingredients==\n*1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]] or [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]], softened\n* 1 package (8 ounces) [[Cookbook:Cream Cheese|cream cheese]], softened\n* 1 ½ cups granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]], divided\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla]] extract\n* 2 cups [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n*1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n*½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n*¼ teaspoon salt\n*¼ cup [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n*1 cup semisweet [[Cookbook:Chocolate|chocolate chips]]\n*2 cups fresh [[Cookbook:Raspberry|raspberries]]\n*¼ cup [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Pecan|pecans]]\n*1 teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#In a large mixing bowl, combine the butter, cream cheese, and 1¼ cups of sugar. [[Cookbook:Beating|Beat]] until creamy. Then beat in eggs and vanilla. \n#In a separate bowl, combine the flour, baking powder, baking soda and salt; slowly add it to the creamed mixture alternately with the milk. Stir in chocolate chips. Gently [[Cookbook:Folding|fold]] in the raspberries. \n# Pour batter into a greased 9x13-inch [[Cookbook:Cake Pan|pan]].\n# With a [[Cookbook:Fork|fork]], mash brown sugar, cinnamon, and remaining butter until chunky, mixing in pecans if desired. Sprinkle over batter.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 350°F for 50–55 minutes or until a [[Cookbook:Skewer|toothpick]] inserted in several places comes out clean.\n# Cool for 15 minutes. Carefully run a knife or spatula around the edge of the pan to loosen.\n# Cool completely before cutting.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cake]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using raspberry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark chocolate]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Coffee Cake","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 ½ cup butter or margarine, softened","sourceText":"1 ½ cup butter or margarine, softened","amountText":"1 ½ cup butter or margarine, softened","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 package (8 ounces) cream cheese, softened","sourceText":"1 package (8 ounces) cream cheese, softened","amountText":"1 package (8 ounces) cream cheese, softened","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 ½ cups granulated sugar, divided","sourceText":"1 ½ cups granulated sugar, divided","amountText":"1 ½ cups granulated sugar, divided","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 eggs","sourceText":"2 eggs","amountText":"2 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 teaspoon vanilla extract","sourceText":"1 teaspoon vanilla extract","amountText":"1 teaspoon vanilla extract","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 cups all-purpose flour","sourceText":"2 cups all-purpose flour","amountText":"2 cups all-purpose flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 teaspoon baking powder","sourceText":"1 teaspoon baking powder","amountText":"1 teaspoon baking powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"½ teaspoon baking soda","sourceText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amountText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"¼ teaspoon salt","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon salt","amountText":"¼ teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"¼ cup milk","sourceText":"¼ cup milk","amountText":"¼ cup milk","amount":nul